.TH VPNGATE-CLIENT 1 "October 2026" "vpngate-client 1.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
vpngate-client \- GTK4 client for free VPN Gate servers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vpngate-client
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B vpngate-client
is a native GNOME (GTK4 + libadwaita) client for browsing public
VPN Gate servers and connecting through NetworkManager OpenVPN.
Credentials used are the public vpn/vpn pair published by the
VPN Gate Academic Experiment Project, University of Tsukuba.
.PP
With no options it opens the graphical server browser.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-list " [" \-\-country " CC] [" \-\-limit " N] [" \-\-sort " KEY] [" \-\-refresh ]
Print the server list without a display.
.TP
.BR \-\-dry\-run\-host " HOST"
Write the patched .ovpn profile for HOST and validate it.
.TP
.BR \-\-status
Show the active VPN Gate connection and current public IP.
.TP
.BR \-\-disconnect\-all
Remove every vpngate profile, its files, and purge leftovers.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.cache/vpn-gate/
Server list cache and generated profiles.
.TP
.I ~/.cert/nm-openvpn/
Per-connection certificates staged by NetworkManager on import.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR nmcli (1),
.BR openvpn (8)
.SH AUTHOR
Local build by Ajang Supardi.
